{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43966","headline":"辞蜀相妻女诗 · 黄崇嘏","name":"辞蜀相妻女诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一辞拾翠碧江湄，贫守蓬茅但赋诗。\n自服蓝衫居郡掾，永抛鸾镜画蛾眉。\n立身卓尔青松操，挺志铿然白璧姿。\n幕府若容爲坦腹，愿天速变作男儿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄崇嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43966.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43966","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}